  "note": "Round 35, for Wheat on the image-free kit with the standalone Python. Three pairs measure a copy again against the parent its card or its bytes name, with the same weight files as the earlier measurement: Felldude's E4B against the instruct model it stands on, sh0ck0r's Artemis heretic against TheDrummer's Artemis 31B, Pranavz's heretic against LatitudeGames Hearthfire 24B. Kooten's 31B enters on the in-tower name pairing. Dzluck's E2B v2, enkato64bit's 12B (duplicated from Jiunsong's with different weight files) and two E4B QAT copies (coder3101, igorls) fill the eight. DuoNeural's DiffusionGemma copy was held: its export names 1,674 tensors without the model prefix against the original's 1,047, so nothing pairs."
